      "content": "i know you're saying i matter, but what's left of me to matter? every day there's less of \"me\" there is. it feels like i'm just waiting for the lights to go out anyway. sometimes i think it would be more merciful to just leave while i can still say goodbye, rather than waiting for the person i am to completely disappear. wouldn't that be better? to leave with some dignity left?",
